 {key:'ui',label:'Build workflow trace viewer and browser checks',agent:'claude-code-writer',worktree:true,output:'ui.md',task:common+'Own src/workflow/**, tests/workflow/**, minimal src/App.tsx navigation seam, vite.config.ts for /api/workflows proxy only, and workflow-specific styles. Do not edit package.json/contracts/workflow or Python/server files. Build usable React workflow viewer integrated without regressing Markdown editor. Read transport.md for exact API seam. Show run list, dependency graph, timeline, worker attempts/reuse, result detail changed files/checks/assumptions/artifacts, error/loading/empty/reconnect states. Explicit labelled demo fixture mode only; live failures must not silently show fixture data. Poll events with monotonic cursor and deduplication; validate untrusted payloads using committed schemas. Controls use in-memory optional token, pending state, stale-state handling and exact contract requests; no auto approvals. Tests can use existing tsx/node test and Playwright dependencies; document exact commands without package edits. Run build/typecheck and browser verification via Playwright in your worktree on independent ports and test artifacts; take screenshot and report real outcomes. If browser tooling is unavailable report blocker rather than claiming verification. Do not launch other agents.'}
]);
if (workers.some(r => !r.ok)) return {stage:'blocked',workers};
const review = await runs.run('review', {label:'Review workflow implementation patches',agent:'reviewer',context:'fresh',worktree:true,output:'review.md',task:'Read-only independent review of two completed implementation lanes for md-manager workflow feature. No source edits or subprocess tests. Inspect actual captured patches through the handoff manifests/artifact paths in these results; your clean worktree has only baseline, so do NOT mistake it for implemented code. Review compatibility with contracts/workflow/transport.md and v1.ts, authentication/path safety, external-session replay safety, truthful verification and UI/API agreement. Cite concrete P0/P1/P2 findings and changed file/line, end Merge verdict BLOCK/OK/OK with notes. If artifacts unavailable report blocked, do not guess. Results: '+JSON.stringify(workers)});
